  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "But if you look closely at what's actually being written about — the *depth* of coverage, the *breadth* of the ecosystem, and the *specific technologies* that are reshaping how software gets built — you'll notice something strange",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The most important developments are happening in plain sight, but they're being covered in fragments",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This post is an attempt to fill those blind spots",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To understand where AI full-stack development actually stands in 2026, we need to look at three emerging paradigms that the mainstream coverage is largely missing:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "But it breaks down at scale because the context window is finite",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The core insight from [coleam00/context-engineering-intro](https://github.com/coleam00/context-engineering-intro) (13.5K stars, updated 2026-07-02) is this:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Context Engineering is 10x better than prompt engineering and 100x better than vibe coding",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The fundamental difference between context engineering and vibe coding is **consistency**",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If context engineering is the methodology, agent harnesses are the **operating system** for coding agents",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "ECC](https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC) (Agent Harness OS) is the most popular agent harness framework, with 225K stars as of 2026-07-02",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The core idea: an agent harness is the layer that sits between the AI model and the tools it uses",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers) is the second major agent harness, with 244K stars as of 2026-07-02",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The core idea: Superpowers is a **complete software development methodology** for coding agents",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The framework is designed to be **composable** — you can add or remove skills as needed",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "ECC and Superpowers are similar but distinct:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The most popular is [CC Switch](https://github",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is significant because it acknowledges that **no single agent is the best at everything**",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The future is multi-agent workflows where you choose the right agent for the right task",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the most significant developments in 2026 is **persistent agent memory**",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Traditional AI models are stateless — they don't remember previous interactions",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The pattern emerging in 2026 is **structured data for AI agents**:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "CrewAI](https://github.com/crewAIInc/crewAI) (55K stars, updated 2026-07-02) is the leading framework for multi-agent orchestration",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Task assignment** — Tasks are assigned to agents based on their roles",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The most significant blind spot is **context engineering**",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "But the **systematic approach** to engineering context is largely missing",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    }
